[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2523879513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100109#issuecomment-2523879513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100109","id":2523879513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wb1hZ","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T18:07:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T18:07:20Z","body":"I did a test doing 10 runs in v4.4.dev6.official [1f47e4c4e] and my average was:\n\n```\na base load: 1.48ms\nb base load: 1.57ms\nc base load: 1.81ms\nd base load: 2.16ms\n```\n\nI also tested an unoptimized version compiled with `dev_build=yes` `scu_build=yes` with MSVC  with latest master (v4.4.dev.custom_build [eb5103093])\n\n```\na base load: 2.23ms\nb base load: 2.70ms\nc base load: 3.28ms\nd base load: 3.94ms\n```\n\n<br>\n\nWould be interesting know which CPU you're using, maybe can be hardware related.\n\nGodot v4.4.dev (eb5103093) - Windows 10.0.19045 - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 580 2048SP (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21921.1000) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2523879513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524142861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100109#issuecomment-2524142861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100109","id":2524142861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wc10N","user":{"login":"Habitante","id":46264143,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjY0MTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46264143?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante","html_url":"https://github.com/Habitante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Habitante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:43:51Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:43:51Z","body":"Ok, so your computer is faster than mine. Still, those times are awful. Mine is an older i7-5820K CPU @3.30GHz. Load scene performance in general is very bad. Wether is 2ms, 4ms or 8ms on a desktop computer to load an empty scene with a single node. Thats the kind of performance I would expect from a Gameboy interpreter. What the hell is happening under the hood? Like, converting the .tscn to .json back and forth 10 times?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524142861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526189375","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100109#issuecomment-2526189375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100109","id":2526189375,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wkpc_","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T15:45:51Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T15:45:51Z","body":"I slightly increase the inherit level to eat up the frame time. This is what I get:\n<details>\n<summary>Profile</summary>\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/300866bb-c752-42d9-a58b-02b14cc4bcef)\n\n</details>\n\nIf asking who consume the cpu time, it is Windows.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Per Function</summary>\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d307c31-1990-4721-92e8-b17ea52feb78)\n</details>\n\nOpen file on Windows for the first time is slow and people are complaining about that. And as we logically need to open these files I don't know if we can workaround this.\n\nThis add to about half of the time, rest part should be recursion overhead and other small works.\n\nModified MRP if someone want to profile this: [high_scene_load_times.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18052853/high_scene_load_times.zip)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526189375/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529364099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100109#issuecomment-2529364099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100109","id":2529364099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WwwiD","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T20:21:15Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T20:21:15Z","body":"@YYF233333 Perhaps there is a way that we can cache files we already opened into RAM instead of loading them from disk every time?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529364099/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2530619266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100109#issuecomment-2530619266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100109","id":2530619266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W1i-C","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T07:12:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T07:12:41Z","body":"> Perhaps there is a way that we can cache files we already opened into RAM instead of loading them from disk every time?\n\nThis only happen a first time, the second time you load something it will be retrived from cache already. I disable the cache to simulate first open situation in the MRP. In real case it probably only affects startup time.\n\nBut actually this issue reveals a broader problem. Small files play bad with Windows, and we have a lot of them in the project: `.import` files,  `.md5` files and recently added `.uid` files, etc. These files hurts performance of godot as well as Windows (when you want to move, copy or delete the project). Trying to reduce file and folder count should get some attention.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2530619266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567073956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100109#issuecomment-2567073956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100109","id":2567073956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZAnCk","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-01T16:42:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-01T16:50:35Z","body":"Just for reference:\n\n```\nGodot v4.4.dev7.mono - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon, 09 Dec 2024 11:58:37 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (nvidia; 550.135) - AMD Ryzen 7 2700 Eight-Core Processor (16 threads)\n```\n\nFirst run:\n```\na base load: 0.95ms\nb base load: 0.93ms\nc base load: 0.95ms\nd base load: 1.13ms\n```\nSecond run:\n```\na base load: 0.38ms\nb base load: 0.28ms\nc base load: 0.29ms\nd base load: 0.36ms\n```\n\nOn spinning rust (HDD), using ext4 as a file system. So, yeah, the issue is Windows, not Godot. One issue which could be at play though is all the recent CPU vulnerability mitigations. To be precise, context switching could be a possible culprit. If anything can be done on the Godot front at all, it would be to minimize the IO/system calls. Which would reduce context switches, in turn reducing the overhead caused by all the CPU vulnerability mitigations. Which, to my knowledge, cannot be turned off on Windows.\n\nI have them turned off on my Linux box. And I am seeing far better performance of this MRP. On hardware slower than other people who have tested it so far.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567073956/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825731202","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100109#issuecomment-2825731202","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100109","id":2825731202,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6obTyC","user":{"login":"djrain","id":33777501,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc3NTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33777501?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain","html_url":"https://github.com/djrain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djrain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T23:12:23Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T23:12:23Z","body":"Was just trying to figure out why our game was occasionally taking a 500ms frame on Mac (Godot 4.4) We were loading a couple scenes with `load()` during this frame, and preloading them instead seems to have removed the freeze completely. Both the scenes in question are not huge but do have inheritance, though the freeze seems to only affect one of them... definitely something strange happening here, though could perhaps be a different issue.\n\n<img width=\"316\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d516b77-11c1-4392-acdf-8515c3fb1ad2\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825731202/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]